WEBVTT

s1-merhaba
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.220
Hi! I'm Nedo.

s1-bak
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.816
Today I looked up, and I wondered…

s1-sor
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.048
Why is the sky blue?

s3-gunes
00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:13.600
The Sun sends us light.

s3-beyaz
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:16.019
The light looks white…

s3-sir
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.543
but it's hiding a secret!

s3-renkler
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:20.936
All the colors are inside it!

s3-kirmizi
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:22.214
Red!

s3-turuncu
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:23.239
Orange!

s3-sari
00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:24.040
Yellow!

s3-yesil
00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:24.969
Green!

s3-mavi
00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:25.813
Blue!

s3-mor
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:26.757
Purple!

s4-hava
00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:30.822
On its way to us, the light travels through the air.

s4-tanecik
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:35.307
The air is full of tiny, tiny bits. Too tiny to see!

s4-kirmizi
00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:37.668
Red light zooms straight through.

s4-mavi
00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:40.472
But blue light…

s4-ziplar
00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:46.419
It bumps into the tiny bits, and bounces everywhere!

s5-yayilir
00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:51.255
The bouncing blue light spreads all over the sky.

s5-goz
00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:54.584
So wherever we look, we see blue!

s5-iste
00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:58.160
And that's why the sky is blue!

s6-biliyoruz
00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:01.364
Now we know!

s6-sen
00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:03.644
What do you wonder about?

s6-veda
00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:06.932
See you next time!
